    <string name="settings_telemetry_summary">Help improve LibreSpeed by sharing your test results with the server you test against. Off by default.</string>
    <string name="settings_telemetry_detail">When enabled, the test result (speeds, ping, jitter), your IP address with the ISP and approximate location details the server reports for it, a technical log of the test run, and client information (app version, Android version, device product, CPU architecture and language) are submitted to the tested server after each test. The server operator stores them in their results database and the app receives a link to the stored result. There is no central collection.</string>
